1
00:00:00,456 --> 00:00:03,496
(Leonard:)What are we supposed to do now?

2
00:00:03,668 --> 00:00:05,548
The only thing we can do:

3
00:00:05,712 --> 00:00:08,212
(Sheldon:)Watch TV on our phones
until the criminals return...

4
00:00:08,381 --> 00:00:10,421
(Sheldon:)...and bludgeon us to death
in our sleep.

5
00:00:11,217 --> 00:00:13,637
(Leonard:)Does that mean you've ruled me out
as a suspect?

6
00:00:13,803 --> 00:00:15,383
(Sheldon:)Oh, how I wish I could.

7
00:00:23,104 --> 00:00:24,984
[MUMBLES]

8
00:00:44,625 --> 00:01:08,025
[GROANING]

